                        ["Avatar! I am glad to see thee!"];
                    }
                    ["I was caught in one of those bizarre storms, and seem to be trapped here on this island. If thou wouldst be so kind as to help me free of this place I would be willing to teach thee a spell or two... Or provide thee with a suitable spell scroll if thou art unable to handle spells of such a level."];
                }
